<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>K8s - 分类 - 半生戎码</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/k8s/</link><description>半生戎码 - Jeff 的技术博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.170.1 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-rc.5</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</managingEditor><webMaster>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sun, 19 Feb 2023 22:25:01 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/k8s/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>k8s 安装</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/k8s-install/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Jan 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/k8s-install/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/k8s/">K8s</category><description>&lt;p&gt;目前主流的搭建 k8s 集群的方式有 minikube、二进制包以及 kubeadm。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="minikube-方式安装"&gt;&lt;span&gt;minikube 方式安装&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#minikube-%e6%96%b9%e5%bc%8f%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;minikube 一般用于本地开发、测试和学习，不能用于生产环境，是一个工具，minikube 快速搭建一个运行在本地的单节点的 Kubernetes。&lt;/p&gt;<